:18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-5d1fccaf120bd34e1b26","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-a011eff8f08ca6fbace5","layer":"original","quote":"详、综并为侍中；进封乡侯，兼左、右领军","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-61e74f785c55ca0d946d","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-b8b51f60d2da077720e6","layer":"original","quote":"刘备下白帝，权以现兵少，使综料诸县〖9〗。得六千人，立解烦两部〖10〗；详领左部，综领右部督。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-65a1cb26cba004bf5dd9","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-ee64888b280eee063611","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：是仪、徐详、胡综，皆孙权之时干兴事业者也〖1〗。仪清恪贞素〖2〗，详数通使命，综文采才用，各见信任；譬之广厦，其榱椽之佐乎〖3〗！","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-af9df33232243229b659","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-cea58095c832b2c6a9c0","layer":"original","quote":"徐详者，字子明。吴郡乌程人也。先综死。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-df71c4309624e1aae1a5","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-b31f3eb400a8ebab33df","layer":"original","quote":"封综、仪、详，皆为亭侯","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-f1e3c12ece1bf697c93a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-274cf27e18898b898671","layer":"original","quote":"权为车骑将军，都京〖7〗；召综还，为书部〖8〗，与是仪、徐详俱典军国密事","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-913ec5db27e9333e32b7","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-913ec5db27e9333e32b7","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗二十二年：建安二十二年（公元 217）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-39c60c4f69065f26a257","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o001","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b7c78fcc8111b892643d","layer":"original","quote":"文皇帝讳丕，字子桓。武帝太子也。中平四年冬〖1〗，生于谯。﹝一﹞建安十六年〖2〗，为五官中郎将，副丞相〖3〗。二十二年〖4〗，立为魏太子。﹝二﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab07dc24c0c9b1f10809","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春〖3〗，权令都尉徐详，诣曹公请降；公报使修好，誓重结婚。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o032","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ab07dc24c0c9b1f10809","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春〖3〗，权令都尉徐详，诣曹公请降；公报使修好，誓重结婚。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-14652d6c7f6da05656eb","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-07c8f45fbc8ad2c4659c","layer":"pei","quote":"谭初践官府，上疏陈事；权辍食称善，以为过于徐详","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-24e22a3d02e1b41639fb","start":10,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o061","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-de047b32de569664b9fa","layer":"original","quote":"肃年四十六，建安二十二年卒。权为举哀〖17〗，又临其葬〖18〗。诸葛亮亦为发哀。﹝二﹞","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
